 faces Senji in his first Carnival Corpse, he learns that the effect of using his powers recklessly might be even deadlier than his opponent. Meanwhile, Yoh discovers there is more to Shiro than meets the eye.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5w7XhpsL7Txe5iSGG4ZsK9TH7FA.jpg"},{"title":"Hummingbird","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"7902","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6880","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6880","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42503","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"247997","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"107585","synopsis":"Ganta meets Minatsuki, who’s locked up for killing her abusive father. When Ganta’s efforts to help her escape are thwarted, he’s forced to take on Minatsuki in a Carnival Corpse - and the girl shows her cruel true colors.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aCGIhVZR3clWa9s3txgSsamwS5u.jpg"},{"title":"Il peccato originale","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"7902","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6880","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6880","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42503","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"247997","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"107587","synopsis":"Ganta meets Karako and Nagi, the leaders of the rebel faction Scar Chain, who help Minatsuki out of a potentially gruesome bind. Unfortunately, Ganta also meets Genkaku, a guitar-toting monk with a real talent for brutal violence.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xSVv1qIdcvJm4RiKH1OYE9OOz4o.jpg"},{"title":"La catena della libertà","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"pro